#: crates/cr-addons/src/main.rs:126
msgid "The {addons} add-ons the community made for AD&amp;D Core Rules 2.0 and the Expansion, in one package: races, classes, kits, spells, monsters, equipment, encounters, the characters of the modules and the User Database. {items} items in all, with the pictures that came with them."
